/E (The company specialises in practical, safety-focused training designed to help drivers and operators work confidently, responsibly and efficiently. Its programs cover a wide range of licence categories and specialist areas, including defensive driving, 4x4 and heavy-duty vehicle operation, emergency and VIP driving, commercial vehicle handover training, and earth-moving machinery operation.)
