/E (E&E Driver Training Consultancy is registered with the Human Resource Development Council \(HRDC\), which supports workplace training and skills development in Botswana. HRDC registration is especially useful for organisations that contribute to the Human Resource Development Fund \(HRDF\), as eligible employers can claim back the cost of approved training provided to their citizen employees. This means eligible clients may be able to use the training levy funds they have already contributed to help cover the cost of training their employees through E&E, as long as the training and claim meet the HRDC's requirements and conditions. By choosing an HRDC-registered training provider, businesses can use their training levy to develop the skills of their drivers and operators while also improving workplace safety and making better use of the funds they already contribute towards.)
